  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">School for Indigenous teenagers in Nayar, Mexico</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We will build a self-sustainable and self-sustainable boarding school in the Sierra del Nayar, Mexico for 400 young leaders who live in vulnerable contexts such as illiteracy, marginalization, extreme poverty, etc. Providing them with integral quality education at the secondary and high school level by granting 100% scholarships, forming their personal, artistic, sports, and academic areas, through life skills from transcendence to excellence that are a characteristic pillar of our pedagogy.</narrative>
  </description>
